[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0202","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0202.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0226","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 分块传输编码缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 存在分块传输编码缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送包含超大数据块的 POST 或 PUT 请求触发该漏洞，导致服务器内存耗尽并造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 IIS 4.0 版本，攻击者无需认证即可利用，但无法实现远程代码执行。Microsoft 已在后续安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0226"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-20T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:16Z","remediation":"升级 IIS 4.0 至 Service Pack 6 (SP6) 或更高版本，或升级至 IIS 5.0/6.0 及以上版本。如无法升级，安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-005 对应修补程序 (Q248319)，或在 IIS 管理器中禁用 Chunked Transfer Encoding 支持作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1066","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-018","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0226.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0226","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0226.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0226.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4w69-7m7w-3rmh/GHSA-4w69-7m7w-3rmh.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/middle/Microsoft%20IIS%204.0%E5%88%86%E5%9D%97%E4%BC%A0%E8%BE%93%E7%BC%96%E7%A0%81%E7%9A%84%E7%BC%93%E5%86%B2%E5%8C%BA%E6%BA%A2%E5%87%BA%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2000-0226).html","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0226.yaml","https://github.com/n