://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1058","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-016","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0228.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0228","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0228.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0228.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rw4r-4443-vp93/GHSA-rw4r-4443-vp93.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0228.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/cmjayasinghe/Threat-Intelligence-Dashboard/blob/ccfec8014cc85c9e776b8f657bdb7879139ab5ed/data/cves.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0204.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0214","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0214.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0236","title":"Netscape Enterprise Server 目录索引信息泄露漏洞","description":"Netscape Enterprise Server 3.0/3.6/3.51 版本存在目录索引信息泄露漏洞。当服务器启用目录索引功能时，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的 ?wp-ver-info 和 ?wp-cs-dump 等 Web 发布标签参数，触发目录列表显示，进而获取服务器上的文件结构、目录路径等敏感信息。该漏洞可能导致攻击者进一步探测服务器配置或发现其他可利用文件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0236"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-03-17T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"该产品已停止支持，建议迁移至 iPlanet Web Server 7.0 或更高版本。若暂时无法迁移，在管理界面中禁用 Directory Indexing 功能，并关闭 Web Publishing 扩展模块，同时在服务器配置中禁止 OPTIONS 方法。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1063","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=38D2173D.24E39DD0%40relaygroup.com"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0214.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0210","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0210.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0231","title":"Linux kreatecd 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 系统下的 kreatecd 工具存在权限提升漏洞，该工具盲目信任用户提供的路径参数来定位 cdrecord 程序，未对路径进行充分校验。本地攻击者可通过设置恶意路径替换合法的 cdrecord 程序，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Halloween Linux 4.0 以及 S.u.S.E. Linux 6.0/6.1/6.2/6.3 等多个发行版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0231"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:16Z","remediation":"建议移除 kreatecd 的 setuid 权限位（执行 chmod u-s /usr/bin/kreatecd），或升级到 S.u.S.E. Linux 6.4 及以上版本。如无法升级，可将 cdrecord 路径硬编码为 /usr/bin/cdrecord 并确保该路径不可被普通用户写入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0162.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1061","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19813","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0231.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0231","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0231.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2000/C