06-16T21:51:08Z","remediation":"立即升级 Oracle Web Listener 至 4.0.1 或更高版本，该版本已移除 ows-bin 目录中的危险批处理文件。如无法升级，手动删除或重命名 $ORACLE_HOME/ows/bin/ 目录下的所有 .bat/.sh 文件，并限制 ows-bin 目录的 HTTP 访问权限（仅允许本地回环地址 127.0.0.1 访问）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q1/0211.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1053","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19809","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9b149e946381b5dfe67f5c76cee65997e05f3a01/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0169.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0169","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0169.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0169.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j2cp-x56j-p654/GHSA-j2cp-x56j-p654.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/ows_bin_cgi.nasl","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0169.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0169.json","https://github.com/slacker247/GPDA/blob/fa9006d0877a691f1ddffe88799c844a3e8a669a/Sodi/Run/IDSrules/rule.1202"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0520.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0520.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0520.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0217","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0217.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0239","title":"Atrium Software Mercur WebView WebMail 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Atrium Software Mercur WebView WebMail 1.0 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 WebMail 服务器发送包含超长 mail_user 参数的 GET 请求触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 WebView WebMail-Client 1.0 版本，攻击条件简单，无需身份认证即可远程利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0239"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-15T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:17Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Mercur WebView WebMail 至最新版本；若产品已停止维护，应迁移至仍在安全更新范围内的邮件 Web 客户端（如 Roundcube 或 SquirrelMail）。同时，在反向代理层（Nginx/Apache）配置规则，限制 `mail_user` GET 参数长度不超过 256 字符，过滤畸形请求。在 WAF 上添加规则拦截超长 `mail_user` 参数的攻击负载。临时缓解措施：将服务访问限制在可信 IP 段内，减少暴露面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95325335825295&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1056","http://www.ussrback.com/labs36.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19810","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0239.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0239","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0239.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6a25a9384d7c18dfb53a1d1532073678a2c29fe5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0239.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5gjw-82fr-pgpf/GHSA-5gjw-82fr-pgpf.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/mercure_webview.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0239.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1056/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0217.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0217.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0217.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0175","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0175.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0198","title":"Atrium Software Mercur Mail Server 3.2 POP3和IMAP服务器缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Atrium Software Mercur Mail Server 3.2 的 POP3 和 IMAP 邮件服务组件中存在多个缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器的 POP3 或 IMAP 端口发送特制的大量数据触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Mercur Mail Server 3.2 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0198"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-15T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:12Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 MERCUR Mail Server 4.0 或更高版本（如仍可获得），该版本修复了 POP3 和 IMAP 服务中的缓冲区溢出问题。由于 Atrium Software 已停止运营，该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至其他受支持的邮件服务器软件（如 hMailServer、Dovecot 等）。作为临时缓解措施，可在防火墙限制对 TCP 端口 110（POP3）和 143（IMAP）的访问，仅允许受信任的内网 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/current/0137.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/current/0206.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1051","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19807","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0198.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0198","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0198.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0198.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q5px-r484-x44m/GHSA-q5px-r484-x44m.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0198.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001235.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1051/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0175.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0158","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0158.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0180","title":"Generation Terrorists Designs Sojourn 2.0 路径遍历漏洞","description":"Sojourn 2.0 搜索引擎存在路径遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在 URL 中提交包含 ..（点点）序列的特制请求，绕过目录限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入的文件路径进行充分过滤，攻击者无需认证即可利用，可能导致敏感信息泄露。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0180"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:10Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Sojourn 搜索程序升级至厂商提供的最新修补版本。如产品已停止维护无法获取补丁，应在 Web 服务器层（如 Apache mod_rewrite）添加规则，拦截包含 ../ 或 %2e%2e/ 等目录遍历特征的请求；同时在应用程序入口处对用户输入的搜索参数进行严格过滤，移除所有路径分隔符和特殊字符，仅允许合法搜索词。作为长期方案，建议迁移至仍在安全维护中的现代搜索引擎产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q1/0201.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1052","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4197","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19808","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0180.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0180","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0180.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0180.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xqgx-493j-vhxr/GHSA-xqgx-493j-vhxr.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/sojourn.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0180.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0158.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0176","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0176.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0199","title":"Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 Enterprise Manager 登录凭据弱加密存储漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 的企业管理器（Enterprise Manager）在注册新服务器时，若用户未勾选「始终提示输入登录名和密码」选项，会使用弱加密算法存储数据库登录 ID 和密码。本地攻击者可通过访问系统的配置文件，获取经弱加密处理的凭据数据，利用算法弱点还原出明文凭证，从而获得目标数据库服务器的未授权访问权限。该漏洞影响 Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 版本，CVSS v2 评分 7.2，属于高风险漏洞（AV:L/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C）。官方建议用户始终启用登录提示选项或升级至更高版本的 SQL Server 以规避此风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0199"],"sources":["avd","cve"],"published":"2000-03-14T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 Service Pack 2 (SP2) 或更高版本，同时在 Enterprise Manager 中勾选「Always prompt for login name and password」选项以防止凭据本地存储。由于 SQL Server 7.0 已停止支持，强烈建议升级至 SQL Server 2019 或 2022 等仍在维护的版本，并启用 SSL/TLS 加密连接保护传输凭证。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1055","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2000-0199"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0176.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0207","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0207.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0230","title":"RedHat Linux imwheel 缓冲区溢出本地权限提升漏洞","description":"imwheel 中的 imwheel-solo 脚本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过设置超长 HOME 环境变量触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Halloween Linux 4.0、Red Hat Linux 6.1/6.2 等版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限方可利用此漏洞提权。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0230"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-03-13T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:16Z","remediation":"立即卸载 imwheel 软件包（`rpm -e imwheel` 或 `apt-get remove imwheel`），或升级到已修复此漏洞的版本。如必须使用，可通过 `chmod -s imwheel-solo` 移除 SUID 位以消除提权风险，并避免在 HOME 环境变量中传入超长字符串。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0168.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-016.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1060","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19812","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0230.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0230","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0230.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0230.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m8qj-v452-38v9/GHSA-m8qj-v452-38v9.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0230.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a5d6424c-e1c7-4a7d-af1f-33fa6b7b57e6.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0207.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0207.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0207.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0215","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0215.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0237","title":"Netscape Enterprise Server Web Publishing 目录遍历漏洞","description":"` tags.<value>Netscape Enterprise Server 在启用 Web Publishing 功能时存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标服务器发送特制的 GET 请求至 /publisher 目录，即可利用该目录下提供的 Java applet 浏览服务器上的任意目录，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响启用了 Web Publishing 功能的 Netscape Enterprise Server 版本，CVSS 评分 6.4，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0237"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:17Z","remediation":"禁用 Netscape Enterprise Server 的 Web Publishing 功能（管理控制台取消勾选 Enable Web Publishing），或通过访问控制规则限制对 /publisher 目录的访问（仅允许可信 IP）。建议升级至 Netscape Enterprise Server 3.6 SP3 及以上版本以彻底修复此漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1075","http://zsh.stupidphat.com/advisory.cgi?000311-1","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0237.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0237","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0237.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0237.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r6v6-fr35-cgf3/GHSA-r6v6-fr35-cgf3.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/DDI_Directory_Scanner.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0237.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--9d596320-2f8b-43e6-8e85-4570e3573a1a.json","https://github.com/InfoSecWarrior/Vulnerable-Box-Resources/blob/c784bcf63e1ec5c3a0116043d8653d00f0a21a0b/Vulnhub/OZ/oz-1-nikto-80-output.txt","https://github.com/GokulChandar17/SmartBridgeTeam-2.4/blob/b29f8b2b48be8f40c2ef51cec562a844a6cce660/Project/Nikto%20imperva"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0215.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0215.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0215.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0159","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0159.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0181","title":"Check Point Firewall-1 内部地址泄漏漏洞","description":"Check Point Firewall-1 3.0 和 4.0 版本存在内部地址信息泄漏漏洞。当防火墙处理网络连接时，未能正确过滤数据包中的私有 IP 地址信息，导致数据包中遗留了内部主机的真实 IP 地址。远程攻击者无需身份认证，可通过监听或捕获这些泄漏的数据包，获取受保护网络内部主机的真实 IP 地址，进而为后续针对内部网络的攻击提供信息支撑。该漏洞影响 Check Point Firewall-1 3.0 及 4.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，属于中危漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0181"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:10Z","remediation":"升级 Check Point Firewall-1 至 4.1 及以上版本，并在防火墙规则中启用 anti-spoofing（反欺骗）功能，对所有内部接口配置源地址验证，阻止私有 IP 地址段的数据包泄漏到外部网络。同时建议使用 Hide NAT 对外隐藏内部真实 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0119.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1256","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1054","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0181.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0181","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0181.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0181.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5ffq-p4gq-g2p8/GHSA-5ffq-p4gq-g2p8.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0181.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d56ac691-81de-4b2b-bab2-e847e6e5c63a.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/80642f827c3cd89c2fb8893d0e3fe04ead516ea4/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0159.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0150","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0150.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0171","title":"AT Computing atsar_linux 1.4 本地文件权限提升漏洞","description":"AT Computing 公司开发的 atsar Linux 系统性能监控工具包中的 atsadc 组件存在文件权限检查不当漏洞。由于 atsadc 在写入输出文件时未正确验证文件权限，本地普通用户可通过创建符号链接或利用竞争条件等方式，诱使 atsadc 以 root 权限向任意文件写入数据，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 atsar 1.4 及之前版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0171"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:08Z","remediation":"升级 atsar 至高于 1.4 的最新版本（若已不再维护，建议迁移至 sysstat/sar 替代方案）。临时缓解措施可移除 atsadc 的 setuid 位（`chmod u-s /usr/bin/atsadc`），并限制可登录系统的本地用户范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0102.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1048","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19804","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9b149e946381b5dfe67f5c76cee65997e05f3a01/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0171.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0171","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0171.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0171.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w589-68